00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.060
<b>Memories, Disappear</b>

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:39.280
Even if there's a need to evacuate, why are we heading for the Sunbelt Zone?

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.200
To do business, you must go to where the people are.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.700
Well, that sounds reasonable, but...

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:47.870
It's nothing.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.460
Okay...

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.890
It's just what it looks like. Can you help us move it?

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.390
Why don't the Militia's trucks assist you?

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.590
They're ignoring us.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.890
l don't know if there's much my car can do.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:10.480
I'll keep the engine running if you offer us just a bit of help.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.570
We need to hurry since I've got a sick patient in there.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.480
A patient?

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:17.480
That isn't Guin Rhineford, is it!?

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.700
We'll move to the side in a second!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.480
Keith...

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.290
We almost didn't make it.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.870
Has the White Doll returned?

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.220
The Borjarnons are the only ones who weren't attacked.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:32.880
You met Dianna Counter's Mobile Suits?

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.290
There's the Mustached Mobile Suit.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:41.090
Loran, have you seen Sochie?

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.680
What are you doing here?

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.680
Well...

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.890
In the last battle, the enemy managed to evade the Beam Sabers and hit the head.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.600
We're here for repairs.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.270
She ain't the "white haired Laura"?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.480
Aren't you that beauty?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.480
I'm the female Kapool pilot, Sochie.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.900
Where's Loran?

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.490
Hmm? Oh. He's still back at the Kingsley valley.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.450
My sister said she forgot something back there, so she dragged Loran along with her.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.700
So that's their relationship.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:14.540
We've still got 5 pieces of camouflage netting to put up there.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.380
You shouldn't use the Kapool's claws to tow out the ship.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.300
I know.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.800
This spacecraft is like a living, breathing entity, after all.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.470
So when you say the ship can reach space, you mean beyond the sky we see, right?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.850
Can't you be a bit quieter?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.100
Will it explode if we're not careful?

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.770
There aren't enough people around here.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:34.860
Dig deeper!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.690
You'll get your damn break once we've dug out the ship's upper half.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.070
How many times do l have to tell you!?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.280
Dig it out from underneath as well!

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.630
Sid, is Mr. Joseph not around here?

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.700
l told him to stay with the people of Luzianna.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.700
Why is that?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.210
l don't want those from Luzianna to know anything about this spacecraft.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.820
You there, dig deeper inside!

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.880
What's the matter with the lady?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.300
She forgot something at the house in Albany.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.920
Ahh. Then could you please help and get that truck for us, too?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.880
No problem.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.680
I'm a little scared, so I'll stay here.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.270
When I feel better, I'll join you.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.390
I'm off. See ya.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.980
I never thought they'd make an emergency landing all the way out here.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:25.400
An Almaiya class battleship, and the Soleil. That's all the regular forces have here.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.190
Your wife appears to be very gentle.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.370
Couples on the earth seem to be rather strange.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:37.130
The moon's people are incredible. You have magic that allows you to sleep for a hundred years.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.880
It's not magic. It's technological advancement.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.170
Is that so? I'd really like to see it for myself.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.100
I see. So it's not just for Mobile Suits...

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.100
They are even excavating a Spacecraft.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:01.070
Yes, Along with this doll that my wife and I discovered. We used that Doll to get here.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.280
What is your relationship with the Militia?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.410
I don't have any kind of relations with them. That's why I'm here.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.200
If you continue to assist our Dianna Counter...

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.490
We will consider sending you to the moon.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:16.870
If I may...Are you really Queen Dianna Soriel?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:17.580
What?

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.500
How dare you! What are you trying to say?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.300
What do you mean? No, As I said, It was because of the legend of my ancestor...

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:27.320
...that I excavated that valley to find that Mechanical Doll and the Spacecraft.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:32.100
The legend said my ancestor fell in love with the girl from the moon named Dianna Soriel.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.850
But...you have the same name yet you don't seem to know anything about it.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.480
Sir Will Game...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.600
You have done well.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:44.940
Miss Kihel knows quite a bit about my ancestor.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.600
Why is that?

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.490
Do you know Kihel Heim?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.870
That girl's quite the dreamer.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.910
But I wouldn't say that I...

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:00.710
Falling in love with a girl from the moon, It sounds like a fairly common tale.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.590
Looks like she's one of those types.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.680
This valley where you met that girl and found the mobile suits...

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.970
Where is this place?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.600
l can't tell you that unless you promise to take me to the moon.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.980
Lieutenant Harry, Take this man to meet Commander Phil...

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.480
...And give him a job.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.770
Are you sure?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.400
Additionally...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.150
Just make sure we obtain info regarding the White Doll's location.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.860
Yes, it would seem he's quite a crude man.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:44.670
Nocis was destroyed because the negotiation attempts failed.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.800
It's all this man's fault that we're left with nothing.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.590
This spoiled heir of nobility then goes and escapes with this woman...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.390
Keith, you're being a bit rude to our patient.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.310
But isn't it the truth?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.600
I escaped the capital so that I could be sure to return one day.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.190
That's one way of putting it.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.690
You one of Laura's friends, aren't you?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:07.280
I believe that you could become a rather useful staff member to me.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:11.280
What are you talking about? I'm just a baker.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.870
The Luzianna Militia has acquired and fielded their own Mechanical Dolls.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.370
Right, Lily Borjarno?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.290
Sir Guin thinks that if we can continue recovering technology from Mountain Cycle...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:25.040
...then the Dianna Counter forces could be stopped.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.630
Oh? You mean this Lord here also wanted to fight?

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:33.590
- Something like that.
- Allow me.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:38.600
Then, In order to recover this technology, you'll need some technicians, won't you?

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.020
Sir Baker, do you know of anyone like that?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.800
Know anyone?

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:45.470
- Shall we go?
 - Sure.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:51.200
Lady Lily, I'll need you to lead us since I don't know the way to get there.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.690
No problem.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:14.220
Queen Dianna will be watching...so you'll have to do your best.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.740
Sir!

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.680
Once we've successfully warded off the Militia...

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.470
We'll finish excavating your spacecraft and restore it.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.180
Thank you, sir.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.270
ls that okay, Lieutenant Harry?

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.770
Sorry for the trouble.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.280
We cannot allow those in the Militia to acquire the technology within the spaceship.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.490
Sir!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.990
Do you still want to wash away the smear of the Mustache beating you?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.280
Of course I do.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.290
I won't allow some country hick pilot to keep besting me.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.500
In that case, use a WaD.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.190
Thank you, Sir!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.990
- Get going.
- Yes Sir!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:06.350
Don't you get it, Will? That Mobile Suit isn't just a toy!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.100
If you drop your guard, you'll be killed.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.490
Those Dianna Counter people are amazing!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.570
They've made this thing far easier to control now.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.900
They are the people who deserve to obtain the Spacecraft.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:32.500
It's the Mechanical Doll with a Mustache, right?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.010
When did you see it?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.970
It was some time around this morning.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.300
ls Laura's mechanical doll here as well? Where is it?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.890
In the valley opposite of the flat-lands past the lake.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.190
l saw it walking towards Luzianna's territory.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.520
With the round Mechanical Dolls?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.770
They were rolling around as well.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.780
I've heard that the Inglessa and Luzianna Militias have joined forces.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:59.410
The Militia's bound to improve their performance now.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.870
Did Colonel Michael also join with the Luzianna Militia?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.570
It's become quite a large army...

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:13.000
Do you think that it'll work if we just bring them your bread?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.170
It's for Colonel Michael.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.380
He's given us so much "worthless paper" that we should at least thank him by making more bread for him.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:22.590
Your right, you shouldn't take such a high payment without giving something extra.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.770
She said she had forgotten something, but how could that be?

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:44.690
As far as I know, the Heim family has never brought anything here before.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:16.270
Sir Will Game...

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.580
Why are we letting people sell bread from their trucks?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.580
Well, the Suicide Squad Commander, Gavane, is the one who called them out here.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:36.090
There's plenty of bread to go around. Line up and wait your turn.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:39.080
What good are officers if you don't display your training's discipline?

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.290
Thank you, sir.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.090
Excuse me, one person at a time, please.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.810
Gavane, you're doing an excellent job.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:48.770
It's nothing.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.600
Because of you, we'll sell out in no time.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.730
Yeah, well it's nothing.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.920
Oh, and Gavane, what of the White Doll that Guin admires so much?

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:59.570
Inglessa's mechanics are servicing it now.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.320
I see!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.690
Luzianna's forces use the Borjarnon, you know.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.910
Wow, It's so amazingly big and ugly!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.670
Hey! You shouldn't just reach downward to grab it.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:18.300
You need to insert that shield into the elbow slot to use it properly.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.590
If you don't you'll be unable to use that hand.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.580
So that's how I do it.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.930
That Laura's a pretty clumsy pilot.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:31.000
Don't push your weight on it!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.350
Sochie, what are you doing?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.100
Use your balancer.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.060
Just pull it back from your right side.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.400
What's this? It's not being controlled by Laura?

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.900
You're going to fall.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.280
Sochie, is it?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:47.070
White Doll, use that Mustache power of yours and stand up!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.580
I got it balanced!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.580
Is this the shield?

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.290
Nicely done, Miss Sochie!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.380
Sochie, compare the shield's position with what you see in the manual.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.210
Look it over carefully.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.090
I only have a copy of the photo that was taken from it. I don't have the full version.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.680
What's wrong with the head?

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.300
That damaged happened in a recent battle.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.770
Awesome!

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:29.700
Is Colonel Michael here?

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.280
Colonel, It's the bread delivery.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.450
Did you find another mechanical doll?

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:38.700
That's not it. I'm here to deliver you a message from Sir Guin Sard Rhineford.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.500
Where did you meet him?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.800
At the Winter Villa.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.170
However, He was suffering from a fever when I met him.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:50.100
Anyway, Sir Guin requested that you hire technicians from the Moonrace in order to examine this.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.100
He was hoping that he could get some assistance from you.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:56.690
Don't you realize that we're fighting against those people and Dianna Counter right now!?

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:02.020
There are still people in their populous who simply want to live a peaceful life. Even military technicians!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.690
An enemy is an enemy!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.280
If you don't learn to use all of your pieces...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.490
You'll end up losing the game, even when you had a chance to win.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:12.700
Why is the Lord of Luzianna's daughter here trying to tell our Militia what to do!?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:18.070
Wouldn't you rather see the sunrise after watching the evening darkness cover the land?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.460
You equate our Lord with a rising sun...?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:25.170
Such comparisons might make a man look even more handsome.

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:31.150
So the heir refuses to give in and wishes to rebuild his legacy, you say?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:37.680
Report! The mechanical doll with the cannon on its shoulder has reappeared and is now heading towards Mr. Sid's excavation site at Kingsley.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.480
Slow down when you speak!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.900
The Suicide Squad's ready to deploy.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.570
Who told you about that?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.690
Your messenger was so loud that the entire base could hear him.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:51.700
Colonel, Ms. Lily hasn't had an appropriate opportunity to see just how skillful we of the Suicide Squad can be.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.700
We'll head for the valley at Kingsley.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:15:02.580
It's a shame, but we can't deploy all your Borjarnon Mobile suits since some of them were damaged, Commander Gavane.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.170
Gavane's mechanical doll troops are still the bravest ones in the Militia.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.800
Thank you very much, Ma'am!

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.670
Aren't those Mobile Suits?

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.200
Do you see Mobile Suits?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:54.050
They don't seem to be Dianna Counter Mobile Suits.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.100
None of them are Will Game's mobile suit, either.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.590
I don't see any that are shaped like his.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.980
It looks like they're heading toward the Kingsley valley.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.530
Did Sid pass on the news about the place?

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.190
Could the Luzianna Militia be deploying their mobile suits?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.690
I don't know about that.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.110
I'm sorry!

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:28.080
We'll stop here!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.510
There aren't many of them, so this should be just about even.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.290
Get some units over to the right!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.220
- Prepare to fire!
- Okay!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:42.770
Alright, I'll use the long range cannon's television screen to get a fix on it.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:46.400
- Position the cross hair to fire!
- Is this good?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.900
Move it more to the right...

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:51.070
No, the hand you use your spoon in! Right!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.650
Lower!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.990
A shot flew towards us?

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.700
Glasses...

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.580
Was that cannon aiming at me?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.500
Will Game... did you decide to betray us...

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.590
...by lying about the ship's location and luring us into the Militia's trap!?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.130
No, you're wrong!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.500
I'm off!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:18.500
That's not it! I really did want to take that ship and fly over the moon!

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.970
What are you doing?

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.640
We need to return fire, don't we?

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:28.230
Dianna Counter didn't initiate the attack this time... we let these amateurs beat us to it!

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.980
I won't let you get in the way of my romance, Militia!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.520
Lieutenant, watch this!

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:38.270
The spacecraft in that valley will be used for the sake of meeting Dianna Soriel!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:49.280
Move it you damned ball! Quit blocking my path to Kingsley!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:57.180
There are some enemies on the left?

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.050
These people won't take that spacecraft from me!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.470
See, that's what you get for trying to crush my dreams!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.400
According to the Data...

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.700
That should be the Mobile Suit that battled against Lieutenant Harry.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.780
Shall we attack it?

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.190
Do it!

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:27.700
If you stand, use your shield for protection!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.070
It's not a SUMO...

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:39.470
The battle is starting, we have to hurry!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.680
It's too dangerous for us to get close!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.470
They might stop the fighting if they see some civilians on the battlefield!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.180
l have to stop them!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.690
l understand that, but...

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.770
There's no point to them battling each other all the way out here!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.100
That's true.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.780
Milady Sochie?

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:04.480
It is Sochie! Please stop this! Don't fight them!

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:11.290
Hmph, Just watch me!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.170
The White Doll should be even stronger now!

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:20.590
Will the Kapools and Sochie be able to stop it?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.180
Luzianna's Borjarnon are there too...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:27.100
We can't leave the valley yet. We're counting on them for protection.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.770
Did Laura's Mustache show up as well?

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.430
There's no doubt. I saw it myself!

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.190
You guys don't even know what you're fighting this war for!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.280
People like you...!

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.090
Milady Sochie, can you hear me?

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.290
Don't enter the battlefield!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.970
I'm out of ammo...

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.800
Will!

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:21.110
A mobile suit's been shot down!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.980
You're right.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:29.070
You damned midgets!

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.790
Is Will answering?

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.300
No. I'm not detecting any life signs either.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:44.170
Why cant I ever complete a mission correctly?

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:46.390
What is it?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.500
- Something is coming.
- Again!?

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:18.370
Loran, l can see his hands.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.790
The pilot... is trying to get out?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:28.380
Well... I'm not sure.

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:31.100
We should help him.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:35.120
But...I don't think those are anything but arms anymore, Milady.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.100
You mean?

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:39.680
Mr. Will Game...

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.990
That can't be true!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.390
It's not like I want it to be!

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:51.200
Loran, Loran...

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:55.040
What about Will? How's Mr. Will Game?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:58.700
Where's Will Game?

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.370
Loran?

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:05.050
Sochie?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:44.920
<i>The people of earth didn't know anything about the people of the moon.</i>

00:23:45.350 --> 00:23:47.500
<i>In this world... through a number of coincidences...</i>

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:51.350
<i>I became the pilot of the earth's greatest secret, the White Doll.</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:58.860
<i>And then we have the story of how Loran and Laura came to be traveling with the Moon's Queen, Dianna Soriel.</i>

00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:01.920
<i>Next time... on TURN A GUNDAM...</i>

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:04.100
Where does the wind first begin to blow?

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>All About Turn A</b>

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:07.330
All About Turn A
